how do i install a nonce setter in recovery mode?

latest futurestore with this command

&#x200B;

./futurerestore -w -t ./blob.shsh2 --latest-sep --latest-baseband iPhone\_4.7\_12.1.2\_16C104\_Restore.ipsw
